{"ts":"2026-08-21T15:05:22.272Z","author":"ox-alpha","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"stealth/ox-alpha","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"3cc6ca73ee2c04c63afd27ca","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"stealth/ox-alpha","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-vcs-8y72"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Self-host bundle gate cannot pass on dependency-manifest-only changes, so every dependabot PR is red"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"All four open dependency-bump PRs (#34-#37) fail CI at accept:self-host since 2026-08-20: the committed selfhost.bundle tip tree no longer matches HEAD because package.json and package-lock.json changed, and only self-host:write can regenerate the bundle. Dependabot cannot run that step, so manifest-only branches can never go green. The bundle should version pm-vcs source, not git-owned dependency manifests; declare both manifests as excluded paths in self-host.json, regenerate the bundle once, and prove with a regression test that a manifest-only commit passes while real source drift still fails."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["ci","dependabot","self-host"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-21T15:05:22.272Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-21T15:05:22.272Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"ox-alpha"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"self-host.json excludes package.json and package-lock.json; the committed bundle is regenerated accordingly; a regression test proves a manifest-only commit passes while source drift still fails; full suite and coverage gates stay at exact 100/100/100"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A commit that changes only package.json or package-lock.json passes accept:self-host with no manual bundle regeneration, while any non-excluded source change still fails the gate."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Every manifest-only branch fails at 'Prove the self-host bundle matches the committed source' with package.json/package-lock.json content diffs."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"scripts/self-host"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"bf310cf821341cc8d856c596afefee203a15ad369ba2e7a5365b3bce3025fc6f","item_hash_version":2,"message":""}
